[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":12,"col":11},"end":{"line":12,"col":12}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: `browser-inline` has no run-time markup value yet; it\ncompiles markup written in place, and a `let`, a constant or a helper's argument\nthat names markup where a hole shows it (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.2;\n§5, class 1). Show this markup in a hole of the `view` or of a helper, or build\nthis program with `--platform=browser-tea`."},{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":20,"col":64},"end":{"line":20,"col":73}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"This program's `view` is a value computed when the page runs, not a function\nwhose body the compiler can reach as markup, so `browser-inline` cannot compile\nit: the platform has no renderer to hand a `view` it did not compile. Name a\nfunction, or write a lambda, whose body is the markup\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §5, class 3)."}]
